@startuml STM-5
!include _style.iuml
title STM-5 (System level) — Status of a CreditAccount\ncredit_accounts.status · v1.0 · 01/11/2026

[*] --> active
note left of active
  created with the Driver
  account (UC-ACC-01),
  balance 0
end note
active --> in_shortfall : session debited [balance < 0]\n/ block new app-billed sessions
in_shortfall : top-up credited [balance < 0]\n/ reduce shortfall
in_shortfall --> active : top-up credited\n[balance ≥ 0]
active --> closed : Driver closes the account\n[no open top-up, no running session]\n/ debit unused credit, create closure\nrefunds (STM-10), disable login
closed --> [*]
note right of in_shortfall
  Closing is refused
  while in_shortfall.
end note
@enduml
